  "description": "dotnet new templates for ResultUnion. resultunion-api: a Minimal API with value objects and error catalogs, a use case as one Result pipeline, endpoints that return problem responses, and tests with ResultUnion.Testing. resultunion-grpc: the same feature as a gRPC service whose failures become rich statuses, with tests through the generated client. resultunion-valueobject: a value object (string, int or decimal) with its error catalog. resultunion-feature: a feature with an entity, a repository (in memory or EF Core with SQLite), a service and endpoints in the same shape, or a gRPC service and its contract. resultunion-feature-tests: its tests.",
